blocking 1.7.0 from crates.io with one change: an idle worker exits after
its 500 ms timeout with nothing queued. Upstream joins that test to "the
pool is over its thread limit" with &&, so an idle worker never exits and
wakes the CPU twice a second for good. Drop this copy, and the
[patch.crates-io] entry in ../../Cargo.toml, once a fixed release is out.
